# .lanes-spine: the SHARED files every session would otherwise write at once.
# While two or more lanes are live, a write to any of these ASKS instead of proceeding.
# One pattern per line, gitignore-style. This file is the only place the list lives.
#
# Replace these examples with your own. Typical members: the daily note, the agenda,
# a shared task list, an append-only observation log, a run ledger.
AGENDA.md
TASKS.md
daily/
logs/observations.md
